        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    spot_rate = 2.0979\n    sterling_interest_rate = 1.6025 / 100\n    kiwi_interest_rate = 3.2875 / 100\n    days = 180\n    basis_points_per_unit = 10000\n\n    # Calculate the NZD/GBP forward rate and forward points\n    forward_rate = spot_rate * (\n        (1 + kiwi_interest_rate * days / 360)\n        / (1 + sterling_interest_rate * days / 360)\n    )\n    forward_points = (forward_rate - spot_rate) * basis_points_per_unit\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(forward_points, 3)\n```",
